---
// HTTP timeout stages & transient body/resource closing mechanics in Go net/http.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 330;
---
<figure class="gpht">
  <div class="gpht-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Showdown between http.DefaultClient and DefaultServer with zero timeouts versus configuring granular Dial, TLS, ResponseHeader, ReadHeader, and Client timeouts plus draining resp.Body before closing.">
      {/* Top: Client timeouts */}
      <text x="20" y="26" class="gpht-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Production http.Client: set granular stage timeouts (DefaultClient has 0 timeout!)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. http.Client trên production: khóa timeout từng chặng (DefaultClient hoàn toàn không có timeout!)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Overall bar */}
      <rect x="14" y="44" width="872" height="32" rx="6" class="gpht-bar" />
      <text x="450" y="65" text-anchor="middle" class="gpht-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>http.Client.Timeout (total end-to-end budget, e.g. 5 s)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>http.Client.Timeout (tổng thời gian tối đa từ lúc gọi tới khi đọc xong body, ví dụ 5 s)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Connector rail behind stages */}
      <line x1="120" x2="780" y1="124" y2="124" class="gpht-rail" />

      {/* 4 stage boxes */}
      <rect x="14" y="88" width="202" height="72" rx="7" class="gpht-stage" />
      <DiagramIcon name="network" x={26} y={108} size={18} />
      <text x="52" y="113" class="gpht-b">1. TCP Dial</text>
      <text x="28" y="135" class="gpht-m">net.Dialer.Timeout</text>
      <text x="28" y="152" class="gpht-sm">(e.g. 1 s)</text>

      <rect x="232" y="88" width="208" height="72" rx="7" class="gpht-stage" />
      <DiagramIcon name="shield" x={244} y={108} size={18} />
      <text x="270" y="113" class="gpht-b">2. TLS Handshake</text>
      <text x="246" y="135" class="gpht-m">TLSHandshakeTimeout</text>
      <text x="246" y="152" class="gpht-sm">(e.g. 1 s)</text>

      <rect x="456" y="88" width="214" height="72" rx="7" class="gpht-stage" />
      <DiagramIcon name="stopwatch" x={468} y={108} size={18} />
      <text x="494" y="113" class="gpht-b">3. Wait Headers</text>
      <text x="470" y="135" class="gpht-m">ResponseHeaderTimeout</text>
      <text x="470" y="152" class="gpht-sm">(e.g. 2 s)</text>

      <rect x="686" y="88" width="200" height="72" rx="7" class="gpht-stage is-ok" />
      <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={698} y={108} size={18} />
      <text x="724" y="113" class="gpht-ok">4. Read &amp; Close</text>
      <text x="700" y="135" class="gpht-m">io.Copy(io.Discard, Body)</text>
      <text x="700" y="152" class="gpht-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>keeps TCP Keep-Alive</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>đọc cạn để tái dùng TCP</tspan>
      </text>

      <line x1="14" x2={W - 14} y1="184" y2="184" class="gpht-rule" />

      {/* Bottom: Server + Handler */}
      <text x="14" y="212" class="gpht-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Production http.Server &amp; handler traps</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Bẫy http.Server mặc định và lỗi quên return trong Handler</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="14" y="228" width="426" height="86" rx="8" class="gpht-box is-red" />
      <text x="28" y="252" class="gpht-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Default http.ListenAndServe / http.Error trap (#80, #81)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lỗi ListenAndServe mặc định &amp; thiếu return sau http.Error</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="28" y="274" class="gpht-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Slowloris client keeps connections open forever (0 timeouts)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Client chậm giữ socket mở vô hạn do không có timeout</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="28" y="294" class="gpht-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• http.Error(...) does NOT stop execution without explicit return</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• http.Error(...) không dừng hàm nếu bạn quên viết return</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="460" y="228" width="426" height="86" rx="8" class="gpht-box is-ok" />
      <text x="474" y="252" class="gpht-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Explicit &amp;http.Server{'{'}...{'}'} production defaults</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cấu hình tường minh &amp;http.Server{'{'}...{'}'}</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="474" y="274" class="gpht-m">ReadHeaderTimeout: 2*s · ReadTimeout: 5*s</text>
      <text x="474" y="294" class="gpht-m">IdleTimeout: 60*s · TimeoutHandler for handler work</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Never ship http.DefaultClient or http.ListenAndServe to production: both default to infinite timeouts. Always configure Transport/Server timeouts and drain resp.Body before closing to preserve TCP Keep-Alive connections.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đừng bao giờ đưa http.DefaultClient hay http.ListenAndServe lên production vì cả hai đều mặc định timeout vô hạn. Luôn cấu hình timeout từng chặng và đọc cạn resp.Body trước khi đóng để tái sử dụng kết nối TCP Keep-Alive.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gpht { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gpht-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gpht svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gpht text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gpht-h { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gpht-bar { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .gpht-rail { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .gpht-stage { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .gpht-stage.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gpht-stage.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gpht-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gpht-box.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gpht-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gpht-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gpht-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gpht-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gpht-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  .gpht-pulse-ok { fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gpht-ok,
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gpht-pulse-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gpht-m { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gpht-sm { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gpht-rule { stroke: var(--border); }
  .gpht figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
